00:42:32,381 --> 00:42:36,620
and you see also the joy and the pride of the average Greek

472
00:42:36,621 --> 00:42:40,480
in having such a metropal given to them for a generation.

473
00:42:42,720 --> 00:42:47,720
It gives a pledge that progress does not always mean

474
00:42:47,721 --> 00:42:50,300
the destruction of the past.

