480
00:43:15,080 --> 00:43:20,640
Throughout history, Western civilization has been continually informed and inspired

481
00:43:20,641 --> 00:43:26,640
inspired by the ancient Greek world and its love of beauty and wisdom.

482
00:43:26,641 --> 00:43:30,640
At the height of Athens' golden age, Pericles remarked,

483
